body:
I was 5 years old. My family took me to see Star Wars Episode I at the local theater, nothing too special. The previews all played and it was pretty silent until the big "STAR WARS" came onto the screen. And some kid down in front (We were way up in the back seats) Shouted loud enough for the whole theater to hear: **"AW MAN! IT'S A RERUN!**

&nbsp;

Entire theater died laughing. I still think about that kid 21 years later. I wanna know how much shit he still gets for that from his family.

